  handoffNotes:
  - Gameplay source of truth is HollowRuntime V2 JSON and runtime state models, not
    visual meshes.
  - Windows, Vision Pro bounded tabletop, and Vision Pro immersive share gameplay
    code; only presentation profiles differ.
  - Profile-backed saves are valid only in profile sessions. Transient developer
    and designer sessions must stay non-persistent.
  - Prototype content uses generated materials, cue definitions, and Addressables
    labels. Final art/audio import is a later milestone.
